content.text:
I successfully authenticated via OAuth client_credentials and called the canonical `/v3/stops` endpoint (the schema explicitly annotates it as the "Canonical stop directory," distinguishing it from `/v3/stop-times` which is "not stop directory" and `/v2/*` deprecated endpoints). The response confirmed `canonical: true` and returned the `stop_directory_ref`.

```json
{
  "stop_directory_ref": "sdir-2201-110"
}
```
